0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../LICENSE-BSD-3-Clause.txt
0 // SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
0 // Motor mounting patterns: Copyright (c) 2026, Christian Stroebele (CrispStrobe).
0 // New mechanism, frame, programs and lessons independently authored, 2026.
0 // AD=200, AB=DC=80, BP=CP=160 LDU. 20 LDU = 8 mm.
0 // Reset: A=(-100,0), D=(100,0), B=(-20,0), C=(180,0), P=(80,-sqrt(15600)).
0 // Moving beam planes, rear to front: crank A 60; BP 80; CP 100; crank B 120.
0 // Motors face one another. Opposite raw directions give equal world angles.
0 // All joints use real part holes and pins; no invented connection metadata.
